<title>USA: Res-Care gets expanded credit facility.</title>
<headline>Res-Care gets expanded credit facility.</headline>
<dateline>LOUISVILLE, ky. 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Res-Care Inc said Tuesday its lending group of banks expanded the company's credit facility by $35 million to $100 million.</p>
<p>The company said the expanded credit line provides about $85 million in future borrowing capacity. It said it would use the proceeds to fund acquisitions and related development expenses.</p>
<p>PNC Bank Corp led the group of banks providing the expanded credit facility, Res-Care said in a statement.</p>
<p>((New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610))</p>
</text>
